<title>USA: Praxair acquiring Germany manufacturer.</title>
<headline>Praxair acquiring Germany manufacturer.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS, Ind. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Praxair Inc said Thursday its Praxair Surface Technologies subsidiary is acquiring Coatec Gesellschaft fur Oberflachenveredelung GmbH, a surface technologies company based in Schluchtern, Germany.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Coatec produces dampening rolls for the printing industry that reduce the need for alcohol and other additives to process water and low pressure plasma spraying vacuum coated, corrosion protected blades for industrial gas turbines.</p>
<p>Coatec has annual sales of $8 million.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
